text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures able to block target creature this turn do so.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nFinal Strike deals damage to target opponent or planeswalker equal to the sacrificed creature's power.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a green creature.\nSearch your library for a green creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Bee Sting deals 2 damage to any target.', "Black creatures you control can't be blocked this turn except by black creatures.", 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nCreatures you control gain reach until end of turn. (They can block creatures with flying.)", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nDestroy target nonblack attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to you this turn by attacking creatures.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nReturn one or two target attacking creatures to their owner's hand.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nScorching Winds deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nTarget creature gets +1/+3 until end of turn. Untap that creature.", "Cast this spell only during the declare attackers step and only if you've been attacked this step.\nThis turn, whenever an attacking creature deals combat damage to you, it deals that much damage to its controller.", "Charging Rhino can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Counter target creature or sorcery spell.', "Craven Giant can't block.", "Craven Knight can't block.", "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during their next untap step.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Deep-Sea Serpent can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying", 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', 'Destroy all creatures and lands.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all green creatures.', 'Destroy all lands.', 'Destroy all white creatures.', 'Destroy target creature or land.', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Destroy two target lands.', 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life.', 'Draw a card for each tapped creature target opponent controls.', 'Draw four cards. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Dry Spell deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', "During target player's next turn, creatures that player controls attack you if able.", 'Each player discards any number of cards, then draws that many cards.\nDraw a card.', 'Each player draws X cards.', 'Each player may draw up to two cards. For each card less than two a player draws this way, that player gains 2 life.', 'Each player shuffles the cards from their hand into their library, then draws that many cards.', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', 'Fire Tempest deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', "Fleet-Footed Monk can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or greater.", 'Flying', 'Flying\nCloud Dragon can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\nCloud Pirates can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\nCloud Spirit can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\nWhen Alabaster Dragon dies, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Flying\nWhen Dread Reaper enters the battlefield, you lose 5 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Ebon Dragon enters the battlefield, you may have target opponent discard a card.', 'Flying\nWhen Fire Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Flying\nWhen Ingenious Thief enters the battlefield, look at target player's hand.", 'Flying\nWhen Owl Familiar enters the battlefield, draw a card, then discard a card.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Forked Lightning deals 4 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures.', "Green creatures you control gain forestwalk until end of turn. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Haste', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nWhen Thundermare enters the battlefield, tap all other creatures.', "Hulking Cyclops can't block.", "Hulking Goblin can't block.", 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', 'If an opponent controls more lands than you, search your library for up to three Plains cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'If target opponent has more cards in hand than you, draw cards equal to the difference.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", "Jungle Lion can't block.", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Look at target opponent's hand.\nDraw a card.", "Look at the top five cards of target opponent's library. Put one of those cards into that player's graveyard and the rest on top of their library in any order.", 'Look at the top seven cards of your library. Put two of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order. You may shuffle.\nDraw a card.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\nDraw a card.", 'Return target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Sacred Knight can't be blocked by black and/or red creatures.", 'Scorching Spear deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top. You lose 2 life.', 'Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Search your library for a sorcery card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Soul Shred deals 3 damage to target nonblack creature. You gain 3 life.', 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Stalking Tiger can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Tap all nonwhite creatures.', 'Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', 'Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Burning Cloak deals 2 damage to that creature.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent discards a card at random.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You draw a card for each Forest and green card in it.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You draw a card for each Mountain and red card in it.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', 'Target player skips all combat phases of their next turn.', 'Untap all creatures you control.', 'Vampiric Feast deals 4 damage to any target and you gain 4 life.', 'Vampiric Touch deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker and you gain 2 life.', 'Vigilance', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to any target.', "When Endless Cockroaches dies, return it to its owner's hand.", 'When Fire Imp enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Fire Snake dies, destroy target land.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Mercenary Knight enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a creature card.', 'When Noxious Toad dies, each opponent discards a card.', 'When Pillaging Horde enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a card at random.', 'When Plant Elemental enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice a Forest.', 'When Primeval Force enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice three Forests.', 'When Serpent Assassin enters the battlefield, you may destroy target nonblack creature.', 'When Serpent Warrior enters the battlefield, you lose 3 life.', 'When Spiritual Guardian enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'When Thundering Wurm enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a land card.', "When Undying Beast dies, put it on top of its owner's library.", 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Whenever Charging Bandits attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever Thing from the Deep attacks, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice an Island.', 'White creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'You gain 1 life for each Forest on the battlefield.', 'You gain 2 life for each Mountain target opponent controls.', 'You gain 3 life for each black creature target opponent controls.', 'You gain 3 life for each creature attacking you.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You may play up to three additional lands this turn.', '{T}: Capricious Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.']
